[Music]  the year 2020 meant different things to  different people  for many it was a very difficult year  the lockdown to me was a chance to gain  some perspective  i realized that i was stuck in a rut in  my career and i wanted to break out of  it  so i took the full stack java developer  masters program from simply learn to  up-skill and went from being a junior  business analyst to a software developer  with an 80 salary hike  hi my name is omkar and i am a software  developer at zeo mega after over a year  in my previous job i personally felt  that i was not growing to my full  potential many a times i had to take  help from other experts while writing  the course because i was not able to do  it myself so when i decided to up skill  i specifically wanted java cores that  would help me to become a  self-sufficient software developer  while comparing e-learning platforms i  saw that simplylearn had a job guarantee  program once the course was over  i was getting 10 to 15 callbacks for  interviews in a single week  the response of the support team was  very quick and the trainers were also  very experienced during the interview i  found out that i was able to fit in most  of the roles perfectly because all my  key responsibilities were very well  covered in the course  i am very pleased with the turn that my  career has taken apart from getting a  job i am very much confident with my  abilities as a software developer and i  would like to thank simply learn for  that if there is one thing we all must  learn from my experience is that we must  never settle  don't go through life but grow through  it because growth cannot be locked down

